  \\begin{aligned} \\textcolor{blue}{\\ln\\left( 2 \\cdot 3 \\right)} & \\\\ = \\ln\\left( 2 \\right) + \\ln\\left( 3 \\right) \\end{aligned}
=> \\ln\\left( 2 \\right) + \\ln\\left( 3 \\right)"
`;

