- [ln-pow] ln(aⁿ) = n·ln(a)
  · Le logarithme d’une puissance : ln(aⁿ) = n·ln(a).
  \\begin{aligned} \\textcolor{blue}{\\ln\\left( e^x \\right)} & \\\\ = x \\ln\\left( e \\right) \\end{aligned}
